														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4842485">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> No</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror, Action, Reality-Bending, Existential</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A small room that can only be entered by people in life-threatening, and often anomalous danger. Specifically, here is based off the strange concept of &quot;Safe Rooms&quot; in otherwise very unsafe situations that are often found in Video games.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> SCP-XXXX, also called &quot;The Safe Room&quot;, is an anomalous Steel bunker door that can spontaneously appear on any surface of a dimension greater than 40 inches wide by 90 inches tall. The Safe Room will only appear to persons who are under immediate, life threatening danger, though it had been found that danger of anomalous means greatly increase the chance of SCP-XXXX appearing.</p>
<p>SCP-XXXX can only be opened by the person it appears too (SCP-XXXX-1), and once the door has closed, can only be opened from the inside.</p>
<p>The inside of SCP-XXXX changes every time it appears, but most commonly takes the form of a World War II style underground bunker, filled with equipment and supplies. Both the equipment and supplies that appear in SCP-XXXX always pertain to the SCP-XXXX-1 current situation and offer some form of assistance to solve the issue.</p>
<p>In one corner of SCP-XXXX, a cloaked figure of indeterminable race, age and gender, stands behind a small stall. This figure, SCP-XXXX-A, will offer to sell SCP-XXXX-1 all manner of strange and often Anomalous items (even several supposedly contained SCPs after been offered).</p>
<p>However, the form of payment seems to change randomly and wildly. To date, payment methods have included; USD, AUD, Yen, 1oz 2o karat gold coins, Memories, Lifespan, First born Son, and many others.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The hook here would be a collection of both known manifestations and experimental logs and even possibly short stories detailing different people's encounters with the Safe Room, what it helped them to escape, and what it cost them in the end.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong></p>

