						<a href="/scp-5510/comments/show">SCP-5510</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4842448">
									

<p>While this was definitely clever I feel like it should be in the SCP-J category rather than in the official database for a variety of reasons. The lack of info which helps this article regarding its rating does not fit the official SCP guidelines that everyone likes to use as it’s basically a empty page that’s a joke. This reminds me of the procrastination rock joke SCP which did extremely well and I think this would be better in the J category but I still gave it +1 because it was quite clever. Again probably needs to be an <strong>-J</strong>.</p>

							</div>

								
					
